flowchart TD
    START[POST /api/v1/reviews] --> VAL[字段验证 mood 1-5 + completed_task_ids 等]
    VAL --> STATE{plan.status ∈ active/adopted?}
    STATE -->|否| ERR[409 STATE_PLAN_NOT_REVIEWABLE]
    STATE -->|是| STATS[service 计算 consecutive_* 写 reviews 表]
    STATS --> RULE[规则判定层 高频模式查规则表]
    RULE --> HIT{规则命中?}
    HIT -->|是| APPLY[确定性调整 e.g. 连续 abandoned≥2 → 减量]
    HIT -->|否| AGENT[Agent 兜底层 LLM 综合判断 必须明示理由]
    APPLY --> DECISION{suggested_replan?}
    AGENT --> DECISION
    DECISION -->|true + 用户接受| ACCEPT[POST /reviews/id/accept-replan]
    DECISION -->|true + 用户拒绝| RET[仅记录 companion_message]
    DECISION -->|false| RET
    ACCEPT --> NEWRUN[新建 plan_run hint_intent=replan + source_plan_id]
    NEWRUN --> M2[→ 模块 02 生成规划]
